			"value": "title: optimizePackageImports\ndescription: API Reference for optimizePackageImports Next.js Config Option\nversion: experimental"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Some packages can export hundreds or thousands of modules, which can cause performance issues in development and production."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Adding a package to "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "experimental.optimizePackageImports"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " will only load the modules you are actually using, while still giving you the convenience of writing import statements with many named exports."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
